                <invention-title lang="fr">ENSEMBLE PROFIL AÉRODYNAMIQUE AVEC PLAQUE D'ÉTANCHÉITÉ ET JOINT D'ÉTANCHÉITÉ</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">AIRFOIL ASSEMBLY WITH SEAL PLATE AND SEAL</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An airfoil assembly (60) includes an airfoil fairing (62), a spar (72), a seal plate (80), and a seal (86a). The airfoil fairing (62) has a fairing platform (66) and a hollow airfoil section (64) that extends from the fairing platform (66). The spar (72) has a spar leg (72b) that extends in the hollow airfoil section (64). The spar leg (72b) defines a spar leg periphery (72d). The seal plate (80) is secured with the fairing platform (66). The seal plate (80) has an opening (82a), and the opening (82a) has an opening periphery that is complementary to the spar leg periphery (72d). The spar leg (72b) extends through the opening (82a). The seal (68a) is between the seal plate (80) and the spar leg (72b). The seal (68a) seals around the spar leg periphery (72d).</p>
            </abstract>
